resolution: "Validate ordered mutations in owned disposable state, retain schema/context/session inputs, disclose committed replay, and preserve source/global bytes through actual parser startup and cleanup while ordinary apply retains preparation. Return settings defaults when a validated entry disappears before guarded open while preserving permission/link refusals; verify no-extensions completion previews through the shipped CLI launcher."
